Legends and folklore belong to the cultures that tell them, and are not owned by
anyone here. Some belong to living cultures and faiths; learn them from their own
storytellers.

Third-party parts keep their own licences:
- Map data: Natural Earth (public domain), via world-atlas (ISC licence).
- d3 (ISC licence) and topojson-client (ISC licence), in vendor/ with their licence files.

Storytelling uses Anthropic's API with each user's own API key.
Use of Claude is subject to Anthropic's own terms.
